  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower 50 GBV survivors in Fako, Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">-This project will provide livelihood support and empower 100 internally displaced (IDP) women who are gender-based violence survivors by providing them with vocational training opportunities in hairdressing as well as ensuring they have start-up kits to start their own businesses after training.       -Hadassah Foundation also plans to reduce the risk of experiencing GBV by providing continuous psychosocial support/counseling to the women to enhance their psychological well-being.</narrative>
  </description>
